---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const entries = await getCollection('tools', ({ data }) => import.meta.env.DEV || !data.draft);
entries.sort((a, b) => {
  const ao = a.data.order ?? 999;
  const bo = b.data.order ?? 999;
  if (ao !== bo) return ao - bo;
  return (b.data.date?.getTime() ?? 0) - (a.data.date?.getTime() ?? 0);
});

const shipped = entries.filter((e) => !/development|progress|planned/i.test(e.data.status ?? ''));
const inDev = entries.filter((e) => /development|progress|planned/i.test(e.data.status ?? ''));

const allTags = [...new Set(entries.flatMap((e) => e.data.tags))].sort();

const firstYear = entries
  .map((e) => e.data.date?.getFullYear())
  .filter((y): y is number => typeof y === 'number')
  .sort((a, b) => a - b)[0];
---

<Base
  title="Tools"
  description="Every AI tool I've built and written up — MCP servers, agent harnesses, and the internal tooling that makes work run."
>
  <h1>Tools</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Everything I've built and written up. Most of it is agent plumbing — MCP servers, harness
    pieces, internal tooling — built because I wanted the thing to exist, then documented so the
    next person doesn't have to start from zero.
  </p>

  <section class="tools-counter">
    <div class="tools-stat">
      <span class="tools-num">{shipped.length}</span>
      <span class="tools-label">Shipped</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tools-stat">
      <span class="tools-num">{inDev.length}</span>
      <span class="tools-label">In development</span>
    </div>
    {firstYear && (
      <div class="tools-stat">
        <span class="tools-num">{firstYear}</span>
        <span class="tools-label">First deploy</span>
      </div>
    )}
  </section>

  {allTags.length > 0 && (
    <p class="tools-tags">
      {allTags.map((t) => <span class="tools-tag">{t}</span>)}
    </p>
  )}

  {shipped.length > 0 && <h2>Shipped</h2>}
  <ul class="tool-list">
    {shipped.map((e) => (
      <li class="tool-card">
        <a href={`/tools/${e.id}/`}>
          <div class="tool-head">
            <h3 class="tool-title">{e.data.title}</h3>
            {e.data.status && <span class="tool-status tool-status-prod">{e.data.status}</span>}
          </div>
          {e.data.description && <p class="tool-desc">{e.data.description}</p>}
          {e.data.stack && <p class="tool-stack">{e.data.stack}</p>}
        </a>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  {inDev.length > 0 && (
    <>
      <h2>In development</h2>
      <ul class="tool-list">
        {inDev.map((e) => (
          <li class="tool-card">
            <a href={`/tools/${e.id}/`}>
              <div class="tool-head">
                <h3 class="tool-title">{e.data.title}</h3>
                {e.data.status && <span class="tool-status tool-status-dev">{e.data.status}</span>}
              </div>
              {e.data.description && <p class="tool-desc">{e.data.description}</p>}
              {e.data.stack && <p class="tool-stack">{e.data.stack}</p>}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </>
  )}

  <h2>The bet</h2>

  <p>
    The MCP protocol consolidated in 2025 — one transport survived (Streamable HTTP), auth
    formalized around OAuth 2.1 + PKCE + Dynamic Client Registration, Cloudflare turned into a
    first-class host. The hard parts of writing a remote, secure, multi-user server are now
    ~80% scaffolded. The remaining 20% is the part I want to be known for: agent-native product
    design — discovery, iteration, context. Most servers expose APIs. The good ones design for
    how an agent actually <em>uses</em> them.
  </p>

  <p>
    The longer bet: agents need trust. MCP today authenticates the user to the server; it
    doesn't carry verifiable identity for the agent acting on the user's behalf. Self-sovereign
    identity is the missing layer there — and
    <a href="/2034/">that's the ten-year bet</a> this work is the agent-side counterpart to.
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .tools-counter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--color-code-bg);
  }
  .tools-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tools-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .tools-label {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .tools-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }
  .tools-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
  }

  .tool-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .tool-card {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .tool-card > a {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
  }
  .tool-card > a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .tool-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .tool-title {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .tool-status {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tool-status-prod {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }
  .tool-status-dev {
    background: var(--color-rule);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .tool-desc {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .tool-stack {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .tools-counter {
      padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
    }
    .tools-num {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
